{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Watercolor",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "After Stamen Watercolor, in its own colours: OpenFreeMap's land, parks, water and roads painted into one render target in colours told apart, a mask selected for each, blurred, roughened by noise fixed to the map and cut; each washed in, mottled where its pigment settles, pooling into darker edges, casting a faint shadow on the paper, under hand-lettered names."
  },
